    "id": "goa-north-to-south",
    "title": "Goa, North to the Quiet South — Five Days",
    "tagline": "Old Goa's basilicas, the north's beach shacks and the south's empty crescents — in one loop, without ever changing hotels twice in a row.",
    "coverImageUrl": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9c/Palolem_Beach%2C_South_Goa.jpg/1280px-Palolem_Beach%2C_South_Goa.jpg",
